":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/renameAction(_:)-5tyj1":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"renameAction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"renameAction(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/renameaction(_:)-5tyj1","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/renameAction(_:)-5tyj1","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol"}}}